<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/generates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The `from` Element generates each `to` Element."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Requirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
